  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth economic and livelihood empowerment through green entrepreneurship and digital transformation in Cote d Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green professions promoted through digital accessibility in schools, Young women and persons with disabilities capacities built in digitalization, Youth digital skills increased through certification in digital software, Digital greenpreneurship is promoted among unemployed graduated young people and young entrepreneurs, Access to green jobs market is increased for young students through promotion of digital skills, IT (Information Technology) skills gained by dropped school youth for better access to job market, Young people&apos;s participation in public life increased though digital sensitization, Youth digital access increased through capacity building and provision of digital infrastructure, Youth access to green jobs and market through digitalization improved, Awareness campaign on digital tools and benefits for the economic and social development of young people</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will empower youth by enhancing their economic well-being and livelihoods through green entrepreneurship and digital transformation in Cote dIvoire. It will provide green jobs and support access to market through digitalization, increasing youth digital access through capacity building and provision of digital infrastructure and raising awareness among young people about digital tools and the benefits for their economic and social development&#xadf8;&#xb9b0; &#xc77c;&#xc790;&#xb9ac; &#xcd09;&#xc9c4; &#xbc0f; &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;, &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xb3c4;&#xad6c;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xc778;&#xc2dd;&#xac1c;&#xc120;</narrative>
  </description>
